### Subdirectory Ring-Fence Exception (`src/howso-service/`)

All source code, scripts, and documentation in this repository are licensed under
the MIT License above, **EXCEPT** for the isolated microservice subdirectory
`src/howso-service/`, which is ring-fenced under the GNU Affero General Public
License v3.0 (`src/howso-service/LICENSE-AGPL.txt`) and communicates strictly over
an out-of-process HTTP/REST network boundary. No AGPL-3.0 code or binary is
linked or imported in-process into the MIT-licensed `.NET` API, Python Worker,
Inference runtime, or root test suite. See `NOTICE.md` for full clean-room
provenance, academic citation, and trademark disclosures.
